  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This model describes the interaction dynamics of a lymphocyte-tumor cell population.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
